onfidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 160.96, "text": "存在一个需要密码的盒子", "end": 166.82, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 168.62, "text": "纪念时刻", "end": 171.68, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 171.68, "text": "打开全会冒出一阵阵太阳", "end": 177.54, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 177.54, "text": "像是警告自己", "end": 181.52, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 182.94, "text": "不能去负相望从前", "end": 186.78, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 190.0, "text": "天变地变", "end": 192.9, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 192.9, "text": "我们的爱也变", "end": 196.7, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 201.38, "text": "而我在这座城市一时有你", "end": 209.06, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 209.06, "text": "身边遗失了自己", "end": 212.64, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 215.08, "text": "以为荒唐到底会有结晶", "end": 220.1, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 222.14, "text": "而我在这座城市失去了你", "end": 230.4, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 230.94, "text": "输给欲望投中的自己", "end": 234.6, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 236.48, "text": "不是你过分的感情", "end": 241.48, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 273.52, "text": "而愛無法撐起", "end": 279.08, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 279.08, "text": "想擁有的 想擁抱的", "end": 287.08, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 290.6, "text": "也為了 同向領悟的結局", "end": 297.98, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 317.38, "text": "我會疲心打壓的想你", "end": 321.56, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 322.36, "text": "我會奮不顧身的前進", "end": 326.36, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 327.08, "text": "遠方煙火越來越細緒", "end": 331.26, "confidence": 0.0, "anchore